<section class='layer-panel' aria-labelledby='terrain-title'>
  <div class='layer-title'><div><h2 id='terrain-title'><span>LAYER 03</span>지형</h2><p>고도 표현
        방식 및 행정 구역</p></div></div>
  <div class='layer-options'><div class='layer-option'><strong>지형 컬러링
        <b data-switch-state>ON</b></strong><button
        class='switch'
        type='button'
        role='switch'
        aria-checked='true'
        aria-label='지형 컬러링'
        data-layer-switch
      ><img src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.toggleOn}}' alt='' /></button></div><div
      class='layer-option'
    ><strong>등고선 <b data-switch-state>OFF</b></strong><button
        class='switch'
        type='button'
        role='switch'
        aria-checked='false'
        aria-label='등고선'
        data-layer-switch
      ><img src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.toggleOff}}' alt='' /></button></div></div>
  <fieldset><legend>컬러링 적용 범위</legend><div class='segmented' data-single-choice><button
        type='button'
        aria-pressed='true'
      >전체 지형<img src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.selectionCheck}}' alt='' /></button><button
        type='button'
        aria-pressed='false'
      >기준 고도 이하</button></div><div class='slider-box'><label><span>기준 고도<output>0m 이하</output></span><div
          class='range-control'
        ><img
            class='range-control__static'
            src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.modalSlider}}'
            alt=''
          /><input
            type='range'
            min='-100'
            max='100'
            value='0'
            aria-label='기준 고도'
            data-unit='m 이하'
          /></div></label><p>슬라이더를 조작하면 '기준 고도 이하' 모드로<br />자동 전환됩니다.</p></div></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>선물 ON/OFF 옵션</legend><div class='layer-options'><div
        class='layer-option'
      ><span><strong>건물 <b data-switch-state>ON</b></strong><small>3D 건물 ON/OFF</small></span><button
          class='switch'
          type='button'
          role='switch'
          aria-checked='true'
          aria-label='건물'
          data-layer-switch
        ><img src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.toggleOn}}' alt='' /></button></div><div
        class='layer-option'
      ><span><strong>행정구역 <b data-switch-state>ON</b></strong><small>행정구역 시각화</small></span><button
          class='switch'
          type='button'
          role='switch'
          aria-checked='true'
          aria-label='행정구역'
          data-layer-switch
        ><img
            src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.toggleOn}}'
            alt=''
          /></button></div></div></fieldset>
  <fieldset><legend>지형 과장 옵션</legend><div class='slider-box'><label><span>지형 높이 배율<output
          >1배</output></span><div class='range-control'><img
            class='range-control__static'
            src='{{rootPath}}/images/{{images.modalSlider}}'
            alt=''
          /><input
            type='range'
            min='0'
            max='2'
            step='0.1'
            value='1'
            aria-label='지형 높이 배율'
            data-unit='배'
          /></div></label></div></fieldset>
</section>